WEBVTT

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:32.780
The holy kingdom of Seyruun.

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:34.680
The royal family's nothing
but a bunch of weirdos...

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:36.720
...but the power it wields
is pretty formidable.

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:38.910
The streets of the capital,
Seyruun City, are arranged...

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:41.650
...to form a giant magical seal
to protect it from attack spells.

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:43.620
Well, like I said,
the place is pretty weird.

00:01:43.690 --> 00:01:45.990
There's a plot to
assassinate Prince Phil...

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:48.490
...and somehow
a Monster is behind it.

00:01:57.570 --> 00:01:58.970
Open the gates!

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:02.440
Philionel el de Seyruun
has returned!

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:05.380
Highness! It's His Highness!

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:07.570
His Highness is alive!

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:12.850
- His Highness!
- Prince Philionel!

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:15.510
Well, it seems you were
worrying about me unnecessarily.

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:18.580
As you can see,
I'm perfectly all right!

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:31.930
Is Phil really this popular?

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.300
Guess this is a case of
"appearances can be deceptive," huh?

00:02:34.370 --> 00:02:35.340
You guys are so mean!

00:02:35.410 --> 00:02:37.930
Appearances have nothing
to do with popularity!

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:41.950
So, you also admit there's a
problem with his appearance?

00:02:57.230 --> 00:03:00.670
My friends! You've all been
worrying unnecessarily!

00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:03.000
As you can see,
I have returned unharmed!

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:07.160
Please...

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:09.230
And I shall make
a declaration now!

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:11.110
I will use all the power at my
disposal to bring the uproar...

00:03:11.180 --> 00:03:14.440
...caused by this assassination
plot against me to an end!

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:20.390
To restore peace to our city
and end this crisis...

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:22.510
...no matter what they may try...

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:26.150
...I promise to find the
people behind this plot!

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:36.890
Anyway, we've got to clear
this situation up fast.

00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:40.700
Yeah... For now, I've
made arrangements for you all...

00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:46.510
...to be in the palace at all
times to act as my bodyguards.

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:51.720
But, once this is solved,
you'll give us rewards, won't you?

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:55.350
I figured you'd ask that.
Don't worry!

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:58.520
I'll give you all
whatever you want!

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:01.250
Oh? To what extent?

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:04.200
How about this?

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:08.930
Oh... You cheapskate! Dealing
with Monsters is a lot of trouble!

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:10.660
How about this much?

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:13.030
Wh-Wh-WHAT?!

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:15.530
Ow! That hurt!

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:17.510
Would you stop?

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:20.610
Who's there?

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:21.700
Big Brother!

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:25.270
Oh, if it isn't
Christopher and Alfred!

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:28.180
Brother, I am gladdened
to the bottom of my heart...

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:31.420
...that you've returned
to us unharmed!

00:04:31.490 --> 00:04:33.890
Yes. I hid myself to
protect those around me...

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:37.860
...from getting hurt
by this assassination plot.

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:43.560
You could have at least told me,
your own brother, what the truth was!

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:46.970
Forgive me. The situation
made that impossible.

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:50.700
Still, there's never
any reason for there...

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:53.870
...to be secrets
between the two of us!

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:56.840
Despite everything
he says, I still think...

00:04:56.920 --> 00:05:00.440
...the most suspicious guy in
this whole assassination plot...

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:02.820
...is Phil's younger
brother, Christopher.

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:06.920
But you needn't worry anymore!
Strong-hearted allies have come!

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:11.050
As you already know, Miss
Lina Inverse is on the case!

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:14.700
Oh, yes! So, you all
saved my brother's life!

00:05:18.270 --> 00:05:21.360
I must thank you! Please
protect my brother from now on!

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:24.770
R- Right. Of course we'll
do everything we can to help.

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:28.080
Seyruun is known as
the white magic capital...

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:30.410
...and we have many
practitioners of it here...

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:34.680
...but white magic can't
really help us in this situation.

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:37.810
But if Seyruun began using
violence and black magic...

00:05:37.890 --> 00:05:41.850
...we'd become a threat to
the kingdoms surrounding us.

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:44.990
Seyruun is best as it is now.

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:48.330
And if anything happens,
we have people like Miss Lina!

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:49.490
Exactly!

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:50.690
That great power...

00:05:50.770 --> 00:05:54.000
...is something I very much
hope to have a chance to see.

00:05:57.240 --> 00:05:58.730
Be polite, Kanzel!

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:01.370
Forgive my rudeness.

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:02.350
Who are you?

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:03.710
Forgive our not
introducing ourselves.

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:09.410
I am Kanzel, court
sorcerer for Lord Christopher.

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:12.010
As am I, Mazenda.

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:16.120
It's an honor to meet
the famous Lina Inverse.

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:18.200
I look forward
to meeting you again.

00:06:18.260 --> 00:06:21.530
So, you work
for Christopher, huh?

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:25.860
Your skill is well known
among your fellow sorcerers.

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:30.130
I hope to get a chance
to see you demonstrate it.

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:34.680
Oh, don't worry.
I think you'll have a chance.

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:37.580
Real soon, I imagine.

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:52.060
What's the story
with that Kanzel guy?!

00:06:52.130 --> 00:06:54.460
It was clear he was
spoiling for a fight!

00:06:54.530 --> 00:06:57.430
It certainly seemed
he didn't like us much.

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:58.970
Of course he didn't.

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:01.940
We got in the way of
his first plot, after all.

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:03.570
What? Are you saying?

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:06.910
If the guy who's after
Phil is Christopher...

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:09.710
...since he has the most
to gain from Phil's death...

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:12.550
...we should suspect those
sorcerers working for him, right?

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:14.050
I see.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:17.450
Besides, they may
not even be human.

00:07:17.890 --> 00:07:21.260
Right. That Monster that
attacked us yesterday...

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.990
In that case, Kanzel
may either be a Monster...

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:26.190
...or has made
a contract with one.

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:27.730
Now that we know this much...

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:30.600
...we should hit them with
the iron fists of Justice!

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:34.200
Amelia, don't you understand?

00:07:34.340 --> 00:07:38.330
Everything we've said
is just pure speculation.

00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:41.740
There's no proof
to support our case, right?

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:43.480
I suppose so...

00:07:43.550 --> 00:07:47.140
Are you thinking we should
just go after them anyway?

00:07:47.220 --> 00:07:49.590
No matter what we do,
it's bad news for us.

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:51.820
It doesn't really matter
to me how we do it...

00:07:51.890 --> 00:07:57.090
...but whatever we do, we have
to consider Phil's position.

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:58.990
That's right.

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:03.430
I understand why you're in such a rush
to close this case, Amelia, but...

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:08.340
It's okay! If you think about
it from the other side...

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:10.310
...the plotter is dead in our sights!

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:13.640
If we get any proof, we can
torture them! Guillotine them!

00:08:13.710 --> 00:08:16.240
Do whatever we want to them!

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:17.710
Hey!

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:20.050
You're right!
In that case...

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:22.310
...let's find that proof
as fast as we can!

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:25.650
Plus, we have to guard
Phil as well as we can.

00:08:25.720 --> 00:08:30.130
Well, I doubt they'll show their
hand so soon after he's back.

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:33.560
This is such a pain. We have
to fight ANOTHER Monster now.

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:37.360
Still, Seyruun seems prone to
these sorts of disturbances.

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:41.810
Never mind this assassination
plot against Phil.

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:46.540
I heard about the loss of the
crown princess, your older sister.

00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:49.980
And there was that bit of treason
the third prince, Randy, tried!

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.140
Zel, come on!

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:55.810
A- Amelia...

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:04.390
That's why... We need an
absolute level of justice!

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:08.030
A burning justice no
evil scheme can withstand!

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:11.660
A blazing justice!
The mightiest justice!

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:14.270
Amelia...

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:19.540
Excuse me. Miss Lina Inverse?

00:09:19.610 --> 00:09:22.100
Yeah, that's me.

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:23.470
Please take this.

00:09:23.550 --> 00:09:26.070
I was told to give
this to Miss Lina.

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:27.350
What is it?

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:28.940
Maybe it's a love letter!

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:31.390
That's the one
thing it CAN'T be!

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:34.990
Shut up.

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:37.490
Well, I'd better go!

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:39.720
Huh? Wait! Who's this from?

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:41.990
If you'll excuse me...

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:44.800
Wait! Oh, wow...

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:46.270
She fell.

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:47.570
You people are heartless.

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:50.340
Hmm... Oh, never mind.

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:51.380
Hey!

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:54.670
Don't just throw it
away without opening it!

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:58.510
But I don't really want to
be getting any love letters!

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:01.990
If you don't open it and read it,
how will you know what it says?

00:10:02.050 --> 00:10:04.280
Oh, you've got a point.

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:06.120
Okay, what have we got here?

00:10:06.190 --> 00:10:07.280
Whoa!

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:09.260
What is it, Miss Lina?

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:12.300
It says he has information on
who's behind the assassination...

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:14.230
...and wants us to
go to a certain place.

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:15.060
What?!

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:16.600
And the guy
who sent it is...

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:19.230
Hmm...
What could he be up to?

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:29.340
Miss Lina,
you're really going?

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:30.380
Of course!

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:34.390
But the one who sent the letter...
I just can't believe it!

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:36.750
Someone has to be using his
name to lure us into a trap!

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:38.380
I said not to worry!

00:10:38.460 --> 00:10:41.390
If it's a trap, at least
we're going in expecting one.

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:43.360
Well, I suppose so.

00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:47.300
And while we're gone,
Zel and Gourry will protect Phil.

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:51.270
All we have to do now is
verify this information.

00:10:51.340 --> 00:10:53.030
Here we are!

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:56.010
'Scuse me! Anybody home?

00:10:58.980 --> 00:11:01.640
No answer, is there?

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.480
You shouldn't invite people
over and then leave the house!

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:08.250
That's why I say he
didn't call us over here.

00:11:12.760 --> 00:11:14.350
Alfred!

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:18.260
Welcome. I'm glad you came,
Miss Lina Inverse.

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:35.510
Just what's this
all about, Lord Alfred?

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:38.280
It's just as I wrote.
I wanted to give you...

00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:40.680
...information concerning this matter.

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:43.780
Then, Alfred... You really did?

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:47.290
Come, we shouldn't just stand
out here talking. Follow me.

00:11:56.740 --> 00:11:58.460
What could this be about?

00:11:58.540 --> 00:12:01.030
Who knows?
Let's just hear him out.

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:16.110
Go ahead. I assure you,
it isn't poisoned.

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:21.960
I'd prefer we get to
the point here, Highness.

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:26.160
Let's be less formal,
Miss Lina. Just call me Alfred.

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:31.560
Okay, Alfred, what's this information
you wrote about in your letter?

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:35.200
Before I tell you,
I have a condition.

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:37.970
In exchange for me
telling you this information...

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:40.070
...I want you to ask
one favor of you.

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:42.080
Well, if you just
want to ASK the favor...

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:43.610
That is acceptable.

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:46.310
So, about the
assassination plot...

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:49.750
The truth is, I don't
know what I should do.

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:51.910
This entire matter
is my father's fault.

00:12:52.590 --> 00:12:55.790
You mean he's behind
the assassination plot?!

00:12:55.860 --> 00:12:56.760
Exactly!

00:12:56.830 --> 00:13:00.660
In other words,
Christopher wants to kill Phil.

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:03.170
Yes. You may have
already guessed this...

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:06.030
...but my father is
definitely the main plotter!

00:13:06.100 --> 00:13:10.060
Uh, hello? Should you really be
so enthusiastic about saying this?

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:13.010
Unfortunately, it's the truth!

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:16.740
It can't be...
My nice Uncle Christopher...

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:20.750
But, why are you telling us this?

00:13:20.990 --> 00:13:23.920
That brings us to the
request I mentioned before.

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:26.220
Your request?

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:29.560
I... I can't stand
this any more!

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:32.760
I want time to
persuade my father!

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:36.890
At this rate, a war will start
between Father and Uncle Philionel!

00:13:36.970 --> 00:13:39.270
Our chief vassals are
already split into...

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:41.670
...Christopher's followers
and Philionel's followers.

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:44.370
A war over who should have
the throne will break out!

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:47.570
Once that happens, I'll be
forced to make a choice...

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:50.510
...to support my father or
do what's best for Seyruun!

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:52.070
Right...

00:13:52.150 --> 00:13:55.450
That's why I want one more
chance to talk Father out of this!

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:59.010
So I want you to wait
until I've done that!

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:03.150
I know if I just keep talking
to him, he'll see reason!

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:06.360
Sadly, I can't
let you do that.

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:08.190
Who's there?!

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:17.300
Hiding is a cowardly act!
Come out and show yourself!

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:20.040
All right, as you wish.

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:25.280
What?!

00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:28.580
A Monster!

00:14:28.650 --> 00:14:30.550
And not the same one as before!

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:35.080
Which means at least two
Monsters are involved in this!

00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:39.530
One is bad enough,
but dealing with TWO of them?!

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:46.330
You people have
overstayed your welcome here!

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:50.940
Look out!

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:56.280
This thing! Even if he
was giving us information...

00:14:56.350 --> 00:14:59.580
...I can't believe she'd
attack her master's son, too!

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:05.850
Amelia, this is no place
to fight! Run for it!

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:06.860
Right!

00:15:06.930 --> 00:15:08.520
Damu Bras!

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:13.490
Miss Lina, this way!

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:15.660
Gotcha! Let's go, Alfred!

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:17.900
R- Right!

00:15:23.240 --> 00:15:25.270
Uh-oh!

00:15:33.150 --> 00:15:35.880
Where is this place?!

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:42.650
The holy barrier around Seyruun
causes trouble for us Monsters...

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:45.200
...so I've opted for a
slight change of venue.

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:48.700
It looks like we've
been pulled into subspace.

00:15:48.770 --> 00:15:50.060
Subspace?

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:52.070
We're inside a
type of magical barrier.

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:54.870
In other words,
it's another dimension.

00:15:54.940 --> 00:15:58.000
And we've been locked inside one?!

00:15:58.080 --> 00:16:00.910
Looks like she
predicted what we'd do.

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:17.080
What is that thing?!

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:20.790
I... I don't know!
I've never seen one before!

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:23.300
I won't be the one
you'll be fighting in here.

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:25.670
He'll do just fine for you!

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:36.210
Fireball!

00:16:40.090 --> 00:16:43.650
Get real! We can't get
distracted fighting this thing!

00:16:44.490 --> 00:16:46.620
"Stars which pass
through heaven's night skies."

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:50.220
"Heed the ancient
covenant with the earth!"

00:16:51.700 --> 00:16:55.530
"I pledge my life
that he may be called forth!"

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:57.730
That's a spell of summoning!

00:16:57.800 --> 00:17:01.570
She must be trying to summon
a creature to fight this magic beast!

00:17:03.010 --> 00:17:05.410
Ferious Breed!

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:18.180
A...

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:19.590
...dove?

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:22.860
This is no time
for cheap tricks!

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:25.320
Come on!
Head for the hole!

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:27.920
Huh? Oh! Right!

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:32.830
Where are we?

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:33.840
A temple?

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:35.570
What's going on here?

00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:37.730
Maintaining power balance
while keeping control...

00:17:37.810 --> 00:17:41.370
...over a pocket dimension
like that is hard work.

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:43.850
So, when I summoned the dove...

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:46.150
...it formed a link
between here and subspace.

00:17:46.220 --> 00:17:49.150
I get it! Miss Lina,
you're really great!

00:17:49.220 --> 00:17:52.620
Yeah, I suppose.
You should compliment me more!

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:58.620
Well, you're really
starting to become annoying.

00:18:04.240 --> 00:18:07.860
Breaking our barrier
was quite impressive.

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:11.670
You may be too much
for Mazenda to handle.

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:15.210
Damu Bras!

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:26.650
No matter where you run,
the result will be the same!

00:18:37.440 --> 00:18:42.170
Ciephied...
Are humans really such fools?

00:18:42.240 --> 00:18:45.870
Nothing can come
of praying to this thing!

00:18:46.710 --> 00:18:48.980
Not exactly.

00:18:49.050 --> 00:18:51.980
It was enough
to distract you!

00:18:52.050 --> 00:18:54.750
Running into a place
which has no way out!

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:55.880
What are you planning?

00:18:55.950 --> 00:18:58.650
To defeat you, of course!

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:01.350
You say the most amusing things!

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:05.860
Amelia, now!

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:06.920
What?!

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:09.260
Flow Break!

00:19:18.980 --> 00:19:21.970
You think this
spell can hold me?!

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:25.980
lmpossible! I'm being held
by a mere human's spell?!

00:19:26.050 --> 00:19:28.210
That's not exactly right, either.

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:30.080
You said it yourself before:

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:33.560
Seyruun is covered
by a holy barrier.

00:19:34.760 --> 00:19:37.850
And this temple is
right in the middle of it!

00:19:37.930 --> 00:19:40.060
Meaning your Monster's
powers are weakened...

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:43.930
...while Amelia's white
magic is strengthened!

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:48.400
Now, how about you
answer some questions for us?

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:53.080
Don't underestimate the
powers of the Monster race!

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:07.850
You really think you can
beat us in your condition?

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:11.830
It looks hopeless, I'll admit.
But here's a little gift for you!

00:20:19.240 --> 00:20:20.360
What is this?!

00:20:21.540 --> 00:20:23.300
What indeed?

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:27.840
You won't get away!
Ray Wing!

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:33.480
Ray Wing! Ray Wing!

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:36.420
Hey, come on! Fly!
Ray Wing!

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:41.090
Miss Lina, what are you doing?
The Monster's getting away!

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:43.930
It can't be...

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:46.660
I can't use my spells...

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:51.000
It must have
happened when she!

00:20:56.010 --> 00:20:59.140
I can't use my spells?
This can't be!

00:21:00.750 --> 00:21:03.870
What am I going to do?!
